WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.667
I'm Nick

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:04.046
Freeeeeeaakin

00:00:04.046 --> 00:00:04.880
Woo, Cage!

00:00:06.048 --> 00:00:07.424
[Therapist] What's
the worry here, Nick?

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:10.052
You've lost some of
your talent as an actor?

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:11.762
No.

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:12.596
(Nick scoffs)

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.682
What did he say?

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.434
[Ted] He says
he loves you, but

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.269
he went in a
different direction.

00:00:20.229 --> 00:00:21.438
[Nick] I'm done.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:22.439
I'm quitting acting.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.608
[Ted] Ah, man, I'm
driving through The Hills.

00:00:24.608 --> 00:00:25.817
I'm sorry.
One more time?

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:28.320
We got another offer.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.821
It's a million bucks.

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:33.784
It's to attend a wealthy
gentleman's birthday party.

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:34.701
[Nick] The guy
that owns this house,

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.036
-What's his name?
-Javi.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.037
-Javi.
-Mr. Cage.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.623
Excuse me, is Javi
going to want me to uh,

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:40.916
-you know?
-I'm not sure I understand.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:41.833
Look, Javi...

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:42.668
I am Javi.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:45.754
Nick Cage.

00:00:46.338 --> 00:00:47.673
God, this place is stunning.

00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:49.174
What is your favorite movie?

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:51.927
That's one of those questions
that's impossible to answer.

00:00:51.927 --> 00:00:53.053
You can't just limit it to one.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.889
♪ Imagine me and you, I do ♪

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.391
[Javi] Is it too much?

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.269
[Nick] Is this
supposed to be me?

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:02.271
It's grotesque.

00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:04.022
I'll give you 20,000 for it.

00:01:05.274 --> 00:01:09.903
♪ I can't see me
lovin' nobody but you ♪

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:13.073
♪ For all my life ♪

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.491
I didn't know
that was a cliff!

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:15.701
We could have died!

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:16.910
(Nick laughs)

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:19.288
(intense music)

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:20.247
I'm in position.

00:01:20.247 --> 00:01:22.040
[Ray] I think that's
the actor, Nick Cage.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.125
Nick Cage!

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:24.751
I love you.

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.211
Have you seen Croods 2?

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:27.379
[Ray] I'm 44 years old!

00:01:27.379 --> 00:01:28.672
Why would I have seen Croods 2?

00:01:28.672 --> 00:01:30.799
I've seen Face Off and Con Air.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:33.176
What do you guys want?

00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:34.678
We're with central
intelligence.

00:01:34.678 --> 00:01:36.388
Do you know who you're
spending time with?

00:01:36.388 --> 00:01:40.100
One of the most ruthless men
on the face of this planet.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.977
I need you to help
the U.S. Government.

00:01:41.977 --> 00:01:42.811
(heavy exhale)

00:01:42.978 --> 00:01:43.979
♪ Let's kill this ♪

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:46.773
Find a way into that room, Nick.

00:01:48.317 --> 00:01:50.193
[Nick] I can see myself
doing more of this stuff.

00:01:50.193 --> 00:01:51.778
I think I might have
a real gift for it.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.405
Good, because we got
another mission for you.

00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:54.406
No, no, no, no, no.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:58.702
Your friend is working
for the U.S. Government.

00:01:58.702 --> 00:02:00.746
Don't lie to me!

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.415
Are those my golden guns?

00:02:03.415 --> 00:02:05.208
They're my golden guns.

00:02:05.208 --> 00:02:06.126
I don't wanna kill you.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.419
You're the last
person I want to kill.

00:02:07.419 --> 00:02:08.211
I Love you.

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:09.171
I love you!

00:02:09.171 --> 00:02:11.590
♪ You'll just be silly ♪

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:12.799
♪ Gimme dangers ♪

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.134
I'm Nick

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:17.929
Friggiiiiiiiiiiiin

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:24.811
(Nick screams)

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.229
Ow! Wooo! Cage!

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.607
(intense music)

